  "notes": "Source list omits 0, 1 and 51; 0 (பூஜ்யம்) is standard but unverified in fetched sources, 1 (ஒன்று) is standard, 51 (ஐம்பத்தி ஒன்று) is pattern-constructed per attested பத்து+unit connectors. Compounds are two words (இருபத்தி ஒன்று) per source. 90 தொன்னூறு (also தொண்ணூறு); 91-99 use தொன்னூற்று+unit per source. Fractions are equivalents not cognates: arai = half (unit+arai fused e.g. மூன்றரை = 3.5), kaal = quarter (1 1/4 spoken 'ஒன்றே கால்', unverified), mukkaal = 3/4. Verify all with a native speaker before production use."
